<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Современная адаптивная страница аналитика">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#07111f">
  <title>Я супер аналитик</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='16' fill='%2307111f'/%3E%3Cpath d='M15 45V34h8v11zm13 0V23h8v22zm13 0V14h8v31z' fill='%237c5cff'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #07111f;
      --surface: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.72);
      --surface-strong: #101f36;
      --text: #f4f7fb;
      --muted: #a6b3c6;
      --accent: #7c5cff;
      --accent-2: #21d4c2;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
      --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 5%, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.22), transparent 31rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%, rgba(33, 212, 194, 0.13), transparent 28rem),
        var(--bg);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.28;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.028) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.028) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 46px 46px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 80%);
    }

    .page {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px 0 72px;
    }

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding-bottom: 44px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 4px);
      align-items: end;
      gap: 3px;
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    }

    .brand-mark i { display: block; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent)); }
    .brand-mark i:nth-child(1) { height: 7px; }
    .brand-mark i:nth-child(2) { height: 11px; }
    .brand-mark i:nth-child(3) { height: 16px; }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .status::before {
      content: "";
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-2);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--accent-2);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 42px 0 76px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 760;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 34px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; }

    h1 {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 8.8rem);
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -0.075em;
      background: linear-gradient(115deg, #ffffff 6%, #b4fff6 38%, #a88cff 72%, rgba(255,255,255,.22) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 42px rgba(124,92,255,.16));
    }

    .hero-line {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 28px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 610px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .scroll-cue { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.84rem; writing-mode: vertical-rl; letter-spacing: .08em; }

    .section { padding: 44px 0; }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .section-index { color: var(--accent-2); font: 700 0.78rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
    h2 { margin: 7px 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); letter-spacing: -0.045em; }
    .section-note { max-width: 420px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }

    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .skill-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 220px;
      padding: 26px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.065), rgba(255,255,255,.018));
      box-shadow: 0 12px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
      transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), border-color .35s, box-shadow .35s;
    }

    .skill-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      right: -80px;
      bottom: -90px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124,92,255,.25), transparent 68%);
      transition: transform .4s ease;
    }

    .skill-card:hover, .skill-card:focus-within {
      transform: translateY(-9px);
      border-color: rgba(33,212,194,.43);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }

    .skill-card:hover::after { transform: scale(1.45); }
    .skill-number { color: var(--accent-2); font: 700 0.78rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; }
    .skill-card h3 { margin: 52px 0 10px; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .skill-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }

    .cases { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }

    .case {
      position: relative;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: var(--surface);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .case-featured {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(124,92,255,.20), rgba(14,27,48,.72));
      border-color: rgba(168,140,255,.28);
    }

    .case-label { color: var(--accent-2); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .case h3 { margin: 18px 0 12px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
    .case p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .case-arrow { display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.5rem; transition: transform .25s ease; }
    .case:hover .case-arrow { transform: translateX(7px); }

    .tag-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 11px; }
    .tag {
      padding: 11px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #dce5f2;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      transition: background .25s, border-color .25s, color .25s, transform .25s;
    }
    .tag:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); color: #fff; border-color: rgba(124,92,255,.6); background: rgba(124,92,255,.14); }

    footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 42px;
      padding-top: 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .88rem;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .hero, .skill-card, .case, .tag { animation: rise .7s both; }
      .skill-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .08s; }
      .skill-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .16s; }
      @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .page { width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px); padding-top: 20px; }
      .topbar { padding-bottom: 20px; }
      .status { display: none; }
      .hero { padding: 34px 0 50px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 19vw, 6rem); line-height: .92; }
      .hero-line { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .scroll-cue { display: none; }
      .section { padding: 34px 0; }
      .section-head { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
      .skills-grid, .cases { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .skill-card { min-height: 190px; }
      .skill-card h3 { margin-top: 38px; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Аналитика</div>
      <div class="status">Данные → выводы → решения</div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="main-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Профиль</p>
      <h1 id="main-title">Я супер<br>аналитик</h1>
      <div class="hero-line">
        <p class="hero-copy">Структурирую информацию, замечаю закономерности и превращаю сложные данные в понятные выводы.</p>
        <span class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true">листайте вниз ↓</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="skills-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="section-index">01</span><h2 id="skills-title">Навыки</h2></div>
        <p class="section-note">Три этапа, которые формируют целостный аналитический подход.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <article class="skill-card"><span class="skill-number">01 / ДАННЫЕ</span><h3>Исследование</h3><p>Сбор, проверка и структурирование информации для дальнейшего анализа.</p></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><span class="skill-number">02 / ЛОГИКА</span><h3>Интерпретация</h3><p>Поиск взаимосвязей, отклонений и значимых закономерностей.</p></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><span class="skill-number">03 / РЕШЕНИЕ</span><h3>Визуализация</h3><p>Подача результатов в ясной форме с акцентом на ключевые выводы.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cases-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="section-index">02</span><h2 id="cases-title">Примеры кейсов</h2></div></div>
      <div class="cases">
        <article class="case case-featured"><span class="case-label">Пример 01</span><h3>Анализ динамики показателей</h3><p>Сравнение периодов, выявление отклонений и визуальное представление трендов.</p><span class="case-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></article>
        <article class="case"><span class="case-label">Пример 02</span><h3>Поиск точек роста</h3><p>Сегментация данных, оценка факторов и подготовка обоснованных выводов.</p><span class="case-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="section-index">03</span><h2 id="tools-title">Инструменты</h2></div>
        <p class="section-note">Пример компактной сетки тегов — названия легко заменить на ваши.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tag-grid" aria-label="Список инструментов">
        <span class="tag">Excel</span><span class="tag">SQL</span><span class="tag">Power BI</span><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Tableau</span><span class="tag">Статистика</span><span class="tag">Визуализация</span><span class="tag">Прогнозирование</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer><span>Я супер аналитик</span><span>Дизайн адаптирован для мобильных устройств</span></footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
